                        <div style={{ display: "flex", alignItems: "center", gap: 12, color: "#c6c6cd" }}><span style={{ fontSize: 18 }}>📖</span><span style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 500 }}>Detailed explanation for every answer</span></div>
